                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/5737: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China (Johnson)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-03T15:00:00-05:00">February 3, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>37. Your 107, February 2, 2 p.m. The Department is studying this matter and
                    desires to receive as soon as practicable a telegraphic report giving the
                    Legation’s views and recommendations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
